            "review_title": "Review at Gusto Italiano",
            "review_text": "Martin S\n16 contributions\n1\nIts not worth the effort of riding the escalator up 4 floors for!\nSep 2015\nHorrible place with poor service; its supposed to be an Italian restaurant. there were 3 of us eating we ordered Pizza, the large size was smaller than a regular 12\" pizza you would normally get in any standard pizzeria and the regular size was like a kids mini pizza. They weren't even very nice, we left there hungry and disappointed. \n\nThe restaurant was devoid of atmosphere and we appeared to be a major inconvenience to staff!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 21, 2015",
