            "review_title": "Review at Gusto Italiano",
            "review_text": "Utnguyen86\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam3 contributions\n0\nNot come back again\nAug 2015 • Friends\nAs I been there with friends for lunch and I invite them for birthday. We choose set menu because the staff give us the picture advertising and the meal in the picture looks very good, so we come with 7 people.\n\nAnd when the food coming firstly with salad, i'm very disappoited because it's different totally with the picture and poor cooking experience, salad with only 1 kind of vegetable and not fresh, my friends choose main food: chicken rice, it looks not interesting and not cook well inside. I choose fried rice with salmon and it's too bad, it looks like I eat only rice with oil so i just eat a half and don't want to eat more. I feel not happy because that's my birthday with terrible food in luxury restaurant. When I ask the staff there about the totally different between food picture and reality, and they say\" Picture are only for representative\" with cool face. \n I told with staff there to give them improvement but maybe they're not willing to hear.\nSurelly, I will not come back again this restaurant.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 21, 2015",
