            "review_text": "Francesco F\nBologna, Italy4 contributions\n0\nSimply Fantastic !!! A very good choice.... i will come back soon\nApr 2015 • Couples\nI was in Diamond Plaza for shopping with my girlfriend...\nOn the 4th floor... there was a pretty hostess that invited us to come and take a look.. and so we came into...\nThe staff was very gentle and nice\nA soft music all around\nThe light not so high... the atmosphere was really comfortable.\nA splendid panoramic view of Hcmc out of the big windows all around...\n\nThe food ?\nJust one word : WOW !!!!!\nWe tasted spaghetti seafood, pizza carbonara, grilled salmon and beef salad.\nDessert tiramisu\nEverything delicious\n\nPS\nThe decoration and presentation of each dish was wonderful and the price ..... much less than we expected !\nRead more\nWritten April 11, 2015",
